      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes. Please make it darker. Im light sensitive with my eyes and it hurts my eyes.\nOntop of that, blue is the color from an monitor thats actually hurting your eyes. So blue is one of the worst colors to have bright.\n\n*Blue light exposure may increase the risk of macular degeneration. The fact that blue light penetrates all the way to the retina (the inner lining of the back of the eye) is important, because laboratory studies have shown that too much exposure to blue light can damage light-sensitive cells in the retina.\n\nI specially feel the pain from blue light myself from screens.",
      "viewerReactions": null
