  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I can't speak for anyone else, but I really like the new loading screen. It feels fluid and comfy, but also \"active\" to where I don't feel like I've been taken out of the game. The only complaint I have with it is the background color. It's a harsh \"daylight\" shade of blue that in most cases makes me squint. I would still prefer it to be colorful as opposed to actual darkness, but I think the current shade is just a little too bright. Making it darker would also give more contrast to the UI elements and the bubble effect.",
